            "Or a doctor devotedly treats patients and receives recognition and promotion. This social causation is no different from the law of karma.",
            "Yet it is still not the law of karma, because it has not reached absolute fairness. Cunning criminals can still deceive the law. Countless cases remain unsolved, and many devoted, kind people are oppressed because they refuse to join forces with wrongdoers."
