            "Religions must now look beyond the limits of language to understand one another, beyond differences in ritual to draw closer, and accept that differences exist while loving one another. Every religion teaches love and charity, yet exempts people of other faiths—an unreasonable contradiction. Charity must first embrace people of every religion.",
